+## Routes
+
+All routes are listed under Routes in [README.md](../README.md).
+
+`POST /import/sales` accepts `{ "csv": "..." }` with header
+`ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty`. Each row sells a positive whole number of dish
+portions at an ISO instant. Previously imported tickets are skipped; errors
+identify the CSV row and leave the entire file unchanged. The response is
+`{ "tickets": 1, "dishes": 2 }`, counting imported tickets and portions.
+
+`GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array of
+`{ "itemId": 1, "theoretical": 2, "actual": 3, "difference": 1 }`.
+Days are inclusive UTC days; difference is actual minus theoretical. Sales
+use is recorded at import time, while actual use includes all consume movements.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
